package notereads

// The characterization suite for T-22 (internal/notereads — the port of
// core/note_reads.py, v0.71.0 THE ONE-OPEN LAW). Per the house law the
// tests were ported FIRST from the reference's own suite
// (app/tests/test_notereads.py @ 98f4fc7) and the golden facts were
// GENERATED by running the unmodified reference via
// testdiff/goldens/dump_notereads.py (never hand-typed):
//
//      python3 testdiff/goldens/dump_notereads.py
//
// Golden files (internal/notereads/testdata/):
//   - notereads_pure.golden.json     the pure parsers + folds + the
//     text-mode read law + the shape adapters + the row-JSON reader
//     (incl. the stars quirk's evidence) + the version gate;
//   - notereads_python_created.db    the PYTHON-CREATED fixture (the
//     acceptance input — every write went through the reference's own
//     NoteReadCache);
//   - notereads_fixture_content.golden.json  the fixture's exact rows
//     (frontmatter_json bytes included — the Go JSON writer's
//     byte-parity pin), the corpus→row mapping, pragma facts, sha tie;
//   - notereads_schema.golden.json   the DDL (adopt-as-is; the CAST-law
//     guard — every column TEXT/INTEGER/REAL-declared);
//   - notereads_behavior.golden.json the reference's own behavioral
//     probes (second-scan counts, stale rows, prune, broken db, the
//     character-budget baseline the Go byte-budget fix diverges from).
//
// The suite's parity legs (cached vs the DIRECT doors' parsers) run
// against the goldens here: the reference's own suite proved
// body_banish_tag_of == wp._note_body_banish_tag and the adapters ==
// the doors' shapes; the goldens carry those reference answers, so
// byte-equality against them IS the parity law. The walk replication
// (TestTheSecondScanOfUnchangedNotesOpensNothing) re-implements the
// banishment walk's ask pattern with a test-local copy of the
// _note_reads_banished predicate (the real one ports with
// internal/websitepipeline, T-23+); the golden's counts — generated
// through the reference's own build_scan_plan — are the law it must
// reproduce.
//
// The documented pre-classified fixes (spec-core-note-reads.md):
//   1. stars restored on DB hits (TestDBHitRowsCarryStars) — the
//      reference's _unified_from_json drops it (golden evidence);
//   2. the RAM budget accounts BYTES, not characters
//      (TestFIFOEvictionIsByteBudgeted) — the reference's
//      character accounting is the golden's ram_budget_chars baseline.

